  PATCH /api/v2/projects/spring-heart-74819093/branches/br-nameless-brook-atzgh1gq  -> protected=True
  PATCH /api/v2/projects/spring-heart-74819093/branches/br-late-recipe-atxl68sh     -> protected=True

THE CHECK. scripts/assert-protected-branches.mjs asks the question that decides whether a
rollback is possible — does the branch still EXIST, and is the PLATFORM refusing to delete
it — rather than the one the guard asked, which was whether our own scripts would refuse a
delete none of them performs. Bylaw 3: a check that cannot fire is removed or made honest.

  $ node scripts/assert-protected-branches.mjs
